00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:04.610
So we remain fully committed
to supporting G Suite

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:06.110
and, of course, Team Drive.

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:09.530
So let's very quickly
talk about the problem.

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:12.110
We're hearing more and
more that IT professionals

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:17.330
are experiencing what they've
dubbed death by 1,000 tabs.

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:21.410
Day to day, a SaaS management
of simple user changes,

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:25.360
