onboarding and offboarding.

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:34.550
These tasks are manual,
repetitive, tedious,

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:37.790
and, of course, they're
prone to human error.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:39.470
And in some cases,
