00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:42.680
So with BetterCloud, IT
admins can take action

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:46.060
across their SaaS apps,
one-off or in bulk,

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.780
and with BetterCloud
Workflows, they

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:51.110
can easily automate custom
sequences that match

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:53.780
