over to Team Drive,

00:26:02.040 --> 00:26:05.430
and now we're able to
continue and extend

00:26:05.430 --> 00:26:08.250
our security to the Team Drive.

00:26:11.280 --> 00:26:15.510
CloudLock's
cybersecurity solution,

00:26:15.510 --> 00:26:17.520
because it's an
API-first mentality,

00:26:17.520 --> 00:26:20.520
is very easy to
deploy, implement,

00:26:20.520 --> 00:26:23.580
and it gets you up and
running within minutes to help

00:26:23.580 --> 00:26:25.710
accelerate the use of cloud.

